# The Linux pack's glue and what no unit builds with: glue.sh and the
# runtime's sources it bundles (src/, which the vm unit names in part in its
# paths), the pack's tests and their fixtures, and its documents. An edit to
# any of these rebuilds no toolchain; it is assembled in seconds.
glue.paths
glue.sh
build.sh
entries
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
src/
test*.mjs
test.sh
vm/fixtures/
vm/.shellcheckrc
